OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused siblings' mother
OL,4,A'in agony' court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 100-year-old mother who was allegedly
OL,7,Fkilled by her well-known hotelier son
OL,8,Fand his sister by giving her liquid
OL,9,Fmorphine was "in agony" the night
OL,10,Fbefore she died, a court has heard.
OL,12,FOxford restaurateur Jeremy Mogford, 79,
OL,13,Fand Sarah Pickering, 72, deny murdering
OL,14,Ftheir mother, Pamela Mogford, in
OL,15,FBledlow Ridge, Buckinghamshire.
OL,17,FShe died at about 00:30 GMT on 15
OL,18,FFebruary 2022, a jury in Oxford Crown
OL,19,FCourt was told.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
