OL,4,A'in agony' court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence, a carer who was
OL,7,Flooking after Mrs Mogford detailed how
OL,8,Funwell she was at the time, saying her
OL,9,Fcondition got "worse and worse" every
OL,10,Fday.
